  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;dja UNCDF: s investeringsplattform f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja genomf&#xf6;randet av UNCDF:s kapitalinvesteringsmandat, fr&#xe4;mst genom anv&#xe4;ndning av garantier som investerare och planerare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the UNCDF Investment Platform in furthering the implementation of UNCDF&#x2019;s capital investment mandate, primarily through the use of guarantees. S/he will advise and support the work of UNCDF&#x2019;s local teams in the LDCs from the origination to the execution, as well as monitoring of UNCDF&#x2019;s debt and guarantee transactions.</narrative>
  </description>
